  triage:description "fenix critical design review, PR #1438 comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1438#issuecomment-5648340494 (2026-09-12T20:01:44Z), reviewed at b06b3e262. doctor/mod.rs:1878-1900,1902-1916 call push_template_override_findings directly rather than through run_doctor_with_runtime_ports (composition at :296), so that composition path is unproven, and there is no both-empty negative case. Sprint D6 requires \"finding ... per row\"." ;
